      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>What is a binary puzzle?</summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">A binary puzzle (also called Takuzu or Binairo) is a logic grid where every cell holds a 0 or a 1. Each row and column must contain an equal number of 0s and 1s, no three identical digits may sit next to each other, and no two rows or columns may be identical.</div>
