      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>Are binary puzzles good for your brain?</summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">Yes. Binary puzzles train pattern recognition, systematic elimination and forward planning with a very light rule set, which makes them an accessible daily brain workout for all ages and a great first step toward harder logic puzzles.</div>
      </details>
